= Migrating from PL/I (F) <pg-migrate>

#idx("PL/I (F)", "migrating from")
A program that PL/I (F) Version 5 accepts compiles with PL1C/370 and
gives the same output and the same condition codes, except where the
later IBM rules that PL1C/370 follows by default differ from PL/I (F).
The option #cmd("-lang=F") keeps PL/I (F)'s rules there as well.

This appendix is in preparation. It will list those differences and the
PL/I (F) compiler options that have a PL1C/370 counterpart.
